\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Of the Father's love begotten
\par Ere the worlds began to be,
\par He is Alpha and Omega,
\par He the source, the the ending, He,
\par Of the things that are, that have been,
\par And that future years shall see,
\par Evermore and evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. By His word was all created;
\par He commanded and 'twas done;
\par Earth and sky and boundless ocean,
\par Universe of three in one,
\par All that sees the moon's soft radiance,
\par All that breathes beneath the sun.
\par Evermore and evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. This is He whom seers in old time
\par Chanted of with one accord,
\par Whom the voices of the prophets
\par Promised in their faithful word;
\par Now He shines, the long-expected;
\par Let creation praise its Lord
\par Evermore and evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Now let old and young uniting
\par Chant to Thee harmonious lays;
\par Maid and matron hymn Thy glory,
\par Infant lips their anthems raise,
\par Boys and girls together singing
\par With pure heart their song of praise.
\par Evermore and evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O ye heights of heaven, adore Him,
\par Angel hosts, His praises sing;
\par All dominions, bow before Him,
\par And extol our God and king;
\par Let no tongue on earth be silent,
\par Every voice in concert sing,
\par Evermore and evermore.
\par                          Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

